WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.270 --> 00:00:07.103
- Salud.

00:00:08.070 --> 00:00:09.600
Adrenal cocktails like this one

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:12.600
are supposed to help with
something called adrenal fatigue.

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:14.550
Its symptoms include trouble sleeping,

00:00:14.550 --> 00:00:15.870
salt and sugar cravings,

00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:17.190
body aches, depression,

00:00:17.190 --> 00:00:18.660
anxiety and brain fog.

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:20.610
But the most common is feeling tired.

00:00:20.610 --> 00:00:22.650
Influencers' unsubstantiated claims

00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:25.620
suggest that these small glands
are getting out of balance.

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:28.380
They swear that regularly
taking these cocktails

00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:30.120
or taking adrenal supplements

00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:33.480
is the answer to getting these
glands back in top shape.

00:00:33.480 --> 00:00:35.280
But do these DIY Cocktails

00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:37.890
or over the counter
supplements actually work?

00:00:37.890 --> 00:00:38.760
On social media,

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:41.610
people are saying that the main
culprit for adrenal fatigue

00:00:41.610 --> 00:00:42.870
is chronic stress.

00:00:42.870 --> 00:00:45.660
More specifically, the way
it makes the adrenal glands

00:00:45.660 --> 00:00:47.250
crank out a lot of cortisol,

00:00:47.250 --> 00:00:48.570
a stress hormone.

00:00:48.570 --> 00:00:49.980
The theory is that over time,

00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:52.470
this overproduction fatigues the adrenals

00:00:52.470 --> 00:00:55.110
and decreases their
ability to make cortisol,

00:00:55.110 --> 00:00:58.530
and then we end up feeling
fatigued or even unmotivated.

00:00:58.530 --> 00:01:01.260
The hormone isn't just related to stress.

00:01:01.260 --> 00:01:03.300
It's also critical for basic functions

00:01:03.300 --> 00:01:05.850
like regulating blood
pressure and sugar levels.

00:01:05.850 --> 00:01:08.340
That's what the combo
of OJ, coconut water,

00:01:08.340 --> 00:01:11.340
sea salt and cream of tartar
is supposed to combat.

00:01:11.340 --> 00:01:14.250
Coconut water and cream of
tartar are high in potassium,

00:01:14.250 --> 00:01:15.540
an electrolyte that's involved

00:01:15.540 --> 00:01:17.280
in maintaining healthy blood pressure.

00:01:17.280 --> 00:01:18.900
sea salt contains sodium,

00:01:18.900 --> 00:01:20.370
another important electrolyte

00:01:20.370 --> 00:01:21.240
that the body uses

00:01:21.240 --> 00:01:23.280
to keep muscles and
nerves working properly

00:01:23.280 --> 00:01:24.690
and to stay hydrated.

00:01:24.690 --> 00:01:26.070
And OJ has vitamin C,

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:27.840
which is an important antioxidant.

00:01:27.840 --> 00:01:29.400
All this sounds pretty good, right?

00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:30.233
But.

00:01:30.233 --> 00:01:31.590
- We do not have any evidence

00:01:31.590 --> 00:01:33.507
to support that this specific
combination of ingredients

00:01:33.507 --> 00:01:36.060
supports the adrenal glands specifically.

00:01:36.060 --> 00:01:37.080
- Or that these ingredients

00:01:37.080 --> 00:01:38.970
affect the amount of
hormones they produce.

00:01:38.970 --> 00:01:40.020
Priya also said

00:01:40.020 --> 00:01:42.600
that for people with kidney
disease or high blood pressure,

00:01:42.600 --> 00:01:43.980
the high amounts of potassium

00:01:43.980 --> 00:01:45.930
in coconut water and cream of tartar

00:01:45.930 --> 00:01:47.460
could actually be harmful,

00:01:47.460 --> 00:01:50.160
and the sugar from
juicing is also not great,

00:01:50.160 --> 00:01:53.400
especially if you're prone
to or already have diabetes.

00:01:53.400 --> 00:01:55.890
Given levels of stress
and anxiety arising,

00:01:55.890 --> 00:01:57.480
this trend makes sense.

00:01:57.480 --> 00:01:58.950
- So when patients come to me

00:01:58.950 --> 00:02:01.080
asking about adrenal cocktails,

00:02:01.080 --> 00:02:03.030
they're hoping to improve
their energy levels,

00:02:03.030 --> 00:02:04.410
potentially improve libido,

00:02:04.410 --> 00:02:06.900
and just improve their
overall sense of wellbeing.

00:02:06.900 --> 00:02:08.490
- She and other hormone specialists

00:02:08.490 --> 00:02:09.570
say that it's not as simple

00:02:09.570 --> 00:02:11.340
as just looking at cortisol levels.

00:02:11.340 --> 00:02:12.780
They naturally go up and down

00:02:12.780 --> 00:02:14.910
depending on a lot of
factors like time of day

00:02:14.910 --> 00:02:16.770
and whether you've eaten.

00:02:16.770 --> 00:02:19.110
The tiredness and other
symptoms people experience

00:02:19.110 --> 00:02:21.540
could be caused by a
variety of health issues.

00:02:21.540 --> 00:02:24.750
- Adrenal fatigue is not
considered a medical disease,

00:02:24.750 --> 00:02:27.960
but your symptoms should
be considered and be heard.

00:02:27.960 --> 00:02:30.240
- Now, there is a
similarly named condition

00:02:30.240 --> 00:02:32.070
called adrenal insufficiency

00:02:32.070 --> 00:02:34.380
with a list of symptoms
that will sound familiar.

00:02:34.380 --> 00:02:37.110
Patients report fatigue, muscle weakness,

00:02:37.110 --> 00:02:39.210
joint pain, loss of appetite,

00:02:39.210 --> 00:02:41.880
craving salty foods and depression.

00:02:41.880 --> 00:02:43.590
But this condition is pretty rare.

00:02:43.590 --> 00:02:44.790
The most common type

00:02:44.790 --> 00:02:47.760
effects somewhere between
50,000 and 92,000 people

00:02:47.760 --> 00:02:48.720
in the U.S.

00:02:48.720 --> 00:02:49.560
By comparison,

00:02:49.560 --> 00:02:51.990
there are more than 6 million
people with Alzheimer's

00:02:51.990 --> 00:02:54.483
and roughly 37 million with diabetes.

00:02:55.740 --> 00:02:57.330
Supplements are also a common way

00:02:57.330 --> 00:02:59.460
that people try to boost
their adrenal health,

00:02:59.460 --> 00:03:01.200
and this is where things can backfire.

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:03.600
Most cases of adrenal insufficiency happen

00:03:03.600 --> 00:03:06.000
when patients stop taking corticosteroids,

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:08.070
which are anti-inflammatory drugs.

00:03:08.070 --> 00:03:10.320
In 2018, researchers found

00:03:10.320 --> 00:03:13.410
that 12 popular adrenal
supplements contained hormones,

00:03:13.410 --> 00:03:15.780
including cortisol and glucocorticoids,

00:03:15.780 --> 00:03:17.820
AKA corticosteroids.

00:03:17.820 --> 00:03:19.470
They did this study after noticing

00:03:19.470 --> 00:03:21.900
that patients with adrenal
insufficiency symptoms

00:03:21.900 --> 00:03:24.750
had one big thing in
common, taking supplements.

00:03:24.750 --> 00:03:27.600
None of the labels had these
hormones listed as ingredients.

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:31.050
- You don't know what's
actually inside the supplement.

00:03:31.050 --> 00:03:33.090
- If you don't have adrenal insufficiency,

00:03:33.090 --> 00:03:35.100
long-term exposure to corticosteroids

00:03:35.100 --> 00:03:36.690
can actually harm your adrenals.

00:03:36.690 --> 00:03:38.820
Manufacturers are only legally required

00:03:38.820 --> 00:03:41.483
to include this disclaimer
on their labels.

00:03:41.483 --> 00:03:42.930
In the last two years,

00:03:42.930 --> 00:03:45.150
the FDA has sent a
handful of warning letters

00:03:45.150 --> 00:03:46.560
to adrenal supplement vendors

00:03:46.560 --> 00:03:48.510
over the claims their products are making.

00:03:48.510 --> 00:03:51.162
The burden of proof that a
supplement might be causing harm

00:03:51.162 --> 00:03:53.310
falls to the U.S. Government.

00:03:53.310 --> 00:03:54.330
The experts I talked to

00:03:54.330 --> 00:03:56.160
said that before taking any supplement,

00:03:56.160 --> 00:03:57.450
you should talk to your doctor.

00:03:57.450 --> 00:04:00.270
They also worry that
self-prescribing adrenal cocktails

00:04:00.270 --> 00:04:02.400
might actually delay
getting at the root cause

00:04:02.400 --> 00:04:03.630
of what people are feeling.

00:04:03.630 --> 00:04:04.650
Doctors also said

00:04:04.650 --> 00:04:07.740
that we shouldn't discount
basic but underrated activities

00:04:07.740 --> 00:04:08.940
that boost our health.

00:04:08.940 --> 00:04:09.900
- You need to walk.

00:04:09.900 --> 00:04:11.340
You need to get your movement in.

00:04:11.340 --> 00:04:12.510
You need to exercise.

00:04:12.510 --> 00:04:13.343
You need to sleep.

00:04:13.343 --> 00:04:14.460
Stay hydrated.

00:04:14.460 --> 00:04:16.200
Manage and reduce your stress.

00:04:16.200 --> 00:04:17.430
Eat a balanced diet.

00:04:17.430 --> 00:04:18.263
- [Daniela] And all of that

00:04:18.263 --> 00:04:19.980
might get you further
towards a healthier life

00:04:19.980 --> 00:04:22.021
than a mocktail or a pill.

00:04:22.021 --> 00:04:24.604
(gentle music)

